OL,3,AClothing factories shut in Bangladesh
OL,4,Aas workers strike over pay
OL,5,
OL,6,FDozens of factories in Bangladesh's
OL,7,Fmain clothes-producing area have been
OL,8,Fshut by workers striking over a higher
OL,9,Fminimum wage.
OL,11,FNearly 150 sites across the country
OL,12,Fhave been closed in the textile hubs of
OL,13,FSavar, Ashulia and Gazipur this
OL,14,Fweekend.
OL,16,FThe garment industry is big business
OL,17,Ffor Bangladesh, generating nearly $40bn
OL,18,F(#30bn) in exports every year and
OL,19,Fmaking up 10% of the country's total
OL,20,FGDP.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
