OL,3,AClothing factories shut in Bangladesh
OL,4,Aas workers strike over pay
OL,5,
OL,6,FWorkers are striking over demands for a
OL,7,Fminimum wage of 30,000 taka (#182) a
OL,8,Fmonth. The minimum monthly wage in
OL,9,FBangladesh is currently 12,500 taka but
OL,10,Femployees say this is not enough to
OL,11,Fdeal with the cost of living crisis.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
